Vendored fonts (static woff2 assets, NOT in the npm closure):
  These faces are self-hosted per design §1.2 (C1/C2 — the console makes zero
  external requests). They are committed static woff2 under src/assets/fonts/,
  fetched at build time from pinned/immutable @fontsource package files via
  scripts/vendor-fonts.mjs (sha256 recorded in src/assets/fonts/README.md). They
  are NOT added to package.json — OFL-1.1 is outside the npm license policy's
  free list, so the fonts stay out of the npm closure. Full OFL-1.1 license texts
  are committed at src/assets/fonts/OFL-*.txt.
  Source Sans 3   / 5.3.0 / OFL-1.1 / https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-sans
                    (via @fontsource/source-sans-3, jsDelivr pinned URL;
                     weights 400/500/600/700)
  Fira Mono       / 5.3.0 / OFL-1.1 / https://github.com/mozilla/Fira
                    (via @fontsource/fira-mono, jsDelivr pinned URL;
                     weights 400/500/700)

Vendored d3 (graph chamber physics — static ES-module sources, NOT in the npm closure):
  The Graph Chamber (NE-134) lays out the governed T2 subgraph with a force
  simulation. The d3-force ES-module source (and the three sibling packages it
  imports) is committed static source under src/vendor/d3/, fetched at vendor
  time from pinned/immutable jsDelivr URLs via scripts/vendor-d3.mjs (sha256 of
  every file + the 3 import rewrites recorded in src/vendor/d3/README.md). Like
  the fonts, these are NOT added to package.json/package-lock.json, so the npm
  closure (and the npm license gate's inputs) are UNCHANGED (C4/C11); the console
  makes zero external requests at runtime (C1/C2). Full ISC license texts are
  committed at src/vendor/d3/LICENSE-*.
